SUMMARY:Aprés Ski Holiday Party
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a cozy aprés ski themed party at Gundlach Bundschu\, where friends\, family\, and neighbors come together to sip\, shop\, and share in the spirit of the holidays and our club community.\n​\nWe’ll be pouring a few special bottles pulled from the family cellar\, enjoying festive snacks including raclette from La Fromagerie included with your lift ticket! You’ll also find exclusive opportunities to stock up for the holidays\, with the best wine sales of the year and cheerful surprises you won’t want to miss. Wreath making\, kids games and DJ Andy Cabic with entertainment for all… and who knows — there might even be a few reindeer games along the way.\n​\nSo bundle up (dress in your favorite aprés ski gear)\, bring your favorite people\, and come raise a glass to a little Bundschu cheer.\n​\nDATE: Sunday December 6th​\nTIME: Noon-4 (Choose between 12-2 and 2-4)​\nLOCATION: Gundlach Bundschu Winery Tasting Room & Courtyard\n​\nTICKETS:$45ea\nGuests under 21 are free\nTickets Include: A welcome splash\, wine samples\, light bites & raclette from La Fromagerie\, wreath making and entertainment.\n​\nGundlach Bundschu & Abbot’s Passage Club members receive two (2) complimentary tickets per membership. Log into your club linked TOCK / RESY account to redeem. \nGET TICKETS
URL:https://www.gunbun.com/event/apres-ski-holiday-party/
LOCATION:Gundlach Bundschu Winery\, 2000 Denmark St\, Sonoma\, 95476\, United States
CATEGORIES:Winery Event,Local
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://www.gunbun.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/GB-Events-Page-Banner-19.png
GEO:38.2751233;-122.4255305
