SUMMARY:169th Deed Day Party
DESCRIPTION:Come celebrate 169 years with us\, taste the club releases\, plus special library gems pulled from the family cellar with a few festive surprises nodding to our German heritage. \nDate: Sunday\, March 14th 2027\nTime: Noon to 4\nLocation: Gundlach Bundschu Winery (Barrel Room & Courtyard)\nTickets: Available January 2027
