SUMMARY:Rhinefarm Summer Social
DESCRIPTION:Our official summer kickoff party celebrating our latest club release and fresh 2026 vintages. Join the Bacchus Club community in the courtyard for an afternoon of new releases\, tasty bites\, and music under the Sonoma sun. \nDATE: Sunday June 6th or 13th\nTIME: Select Noon-2 or 2-4 timeslots\nLOCATION: Gundlach Bundschu Winery Courtyard\nTICKETS: Available March 2027
